  "limitations": [
    "Preview; balance and broad-device performance still being measured",
    "APK installation requires Android confirmation; unknown-source permission may need owner action",
    "Human email/friends and phone-to-phone optical QR acceptance pending",
    "No cosmetic payment storefront; six finishes are free playtest previews",
    "Supplied meshes retain original low polygon geometry; commercial redistribution rights not independently established",
    "Painted raster1774x887 with separate5400px measured detail; UHD rendering does not make the painted bitmap native4K",
    "Local campaigns now resume from a validated atomic save. Network credentials and room state are excluded; remembered account sessions remain unfinished.",
    "Owner confirmed physical rotation in13;14 WindowManager transitions and native acceptance are separately recorded. Broader devices and human cross-phone optical QR acceptance remain open.",
    "18 mapped ElevenLabs SFX plus original and three actual-reference music tracks; technical checks do not establish subjective music approval.",
    "Performance samples are PC view comparisons, not universal benchmarks. Native phone reported thermal status3 during extended testing; no broad-device60FPS claim."
  ],
